korail-api

This independently maintained project is derived from korail-mobile-api.
Original project: https://github.com/yakisoba0728/korail-mobile-api
Base: v2.5.0, commit 7df252357a7fd391db553fdaa012036406fec62d
Copyright 2026 yakisoba0728
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see LICENSE.

Local modifications by thsqaz123-dot (2026) include app-version defaults,
SDK 2.0.1 diagnostic fallback serialization, a selectable curl_cffi-based
OkHttp-style transport and response adaptation, shared proxy handling,
multi-page train search with missing-cursor recovery and deduplication,
regression tests, packaging metadata, CI, and documentation.
The inherited package name and public imports are retained for compatibility.
Additional local hardening suppresses selected sensitive fields only in
default diagnostic representations and adds repository security automation.
Actual attributes, serialization and API protocol behavior are preserved.
Original copyright and attribution notices remain applicable.

The OkHttp-style profile references bogdanfinn/tls-client's
Okhttp4Android7~13 profiles and the curl_cffi custom-fingerprint example,
as documented in src/korail_mobile_api/okhttp_transport.py.
https://github.com/bogdanfinn/tls-client
https://curl-cffi.readthedocs.io/en/latest/impersonate/customize.html

This notice provides attribution and identifies changes; it does not
modify the Apache-2.0 license. See LEGAL.md in the source repository for
